# Monorepo Boundaries

- Root owns portfolio shell, shared auth (planned), cross-project routing
- `projects/lingoleaf`, `projects/lingoleaf-web`, `projects/trellis` keep domain logic
- Never read `.env` files; use `.env.example` for variable names only
- Subproject changes: read root `AGENTS.md` + subproject `AGENTS.md`
- Auth/routing changes: align with `specifications/REPO_SPEC.md`
